{"id":"c25","stage":4,"title":"环保与日常选择","scene":"讨论个人行动和制度的关系。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c25-1","ko":"일회용품을 줄이는 것만으로 환경 문제가 해결될까요?","zh":"只减少一次性用品，就能解决环境问题吗？","note":"만으로 表示仅凭某种手段。","words":[{"term":"일회용품","zh":"一次性用品","id":"5b7cac7374ba3862","audio":"/audio/5b7cac7374ba38621573.mp3"},{"term":"줄이다","zh":"减少","id":"cd093d6c487c80cf","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3"},{"term":"환경","zh":"环境","id":"5d36e09c3271e0e7","audio":"/audio/5d36e09c3271e0e77bdf.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/85c180c69403eb2cd3e8.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"일회용품을","meaning":"一次性用品","explanation":"일회용품（一次性用品）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"일회용품","audio":"/audio/5b7cac7374ba38621573.mp3"}]},{"text":"줄이는","meaning":"减少","explanation":"줄이다（减少）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"줄이다","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3"}]},{"text":"것만으로","meaning":"仅凭这件事","explanation":"것（事）+ 만（只）+ 으로（手段）；将减少用品这一行为名词化。","readings":[{"term":"것만으로","audio":"/audio/4c2126ca4710e3a1d84e.mp3"}]},{"text":"환경","meaning":"环境","explanation":"환경修饰문제。","readings":[{"term":"환경","audio":"/audio/5d36e09c3271e0e77bdf.mp3"}]},{"text":"문제가","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제（问题）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"문제가","audio":"/audio/2c69fc4d7301d4e27b45.mp3"}]},{"text":"해결될까요?","meaning":"能解决吗？","explanation":"해결되다（得到解决）+ -ㄹ까요（询问可能性）。","readings":[{"term":"해결될까요","audio":"/audio/249e8bc30620fc61f0e6.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c25-2","ko":"개인의 노력도 필요하지만 제도적 뒷받침이 중요해요.","zh":"个人努力也有必要，但制度支持很重要。","note":"뒷받침 指支持或支撑。","words":[{"term":"개인","zh":"个人","id":"9b679df05d68aaba","audio":"/audio/9b679df05d68aaba608e.mp3"},{"term":"노력","zh":"努力","id":"1119b060db74766f","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3"},{"term":"뒷받침","zh":"支持","id":"991055306e5474a8","audio":"/audio/991055306e5474a8974b.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/95a911841324ec803f5a.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"개인의","meaning":"个人的","explanation":"개인（个人）+ 의（修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"개인","audio":"/audio/9b679df05d68aaba608e.mp3"}]},{"text":"노력도","meaning":"努力也","explanation":"노력（努力）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"노력","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3"}]},{"text":"필요하지만","meaning":"有必要，不过","explanation":"필요하다（必要）+ -지만（转折）。","readings":[{"term":"필요하지만","audio":"/audio/7a08d3677566b3d3a422.mp3"}]},{"text":"제도적","meaning":"制度层面的","explanation":"제도（制度）+ 적（具有该性质的），修饰뒷받침。","readings":[{"term":"뒷받침","audio":"/audio/991055306e5474a8974b.mp3"}]},{"text":"뒷받침이","meaning":"支持","explanation":"뒷받침（支撑、支持）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"뒷받침","audio":"/audio/991055306e5474a8974b.mp3"}]},{"text":"중요해요.","meaning":"很重要","explanation":"중요하다（重要）的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"중요해요","audio":"/audio/efa6ee653c8aad7ee6ab.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c25-3","ko":"기업의 생산 방식도 달라져야 하겠네요.","zh":"企业的生产方式也应该改变。","note":"对前一句作出延伸推论。","words":[{"term":"기업","zh":"企业","id":"120a4a40716cc36a","audio":"/audio/120a4a40716cc36a6a5d.mp3"},{"term":"생산","zh":"生产","id":"b3df362a51cdd23e","audio":"/audio/b3df362a51cdd23e8944.mp3"},{"term":"방식","zh":"方式","id":"3f5e5497216f63d3","audio":"/audio/3f5e5497216f63d32822.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/80a6cef9c2653977047e.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"기업의","meaning":"企业的","explanation":"기업（企业）+ 의（所属关系）。","readings":[{"term":"기업","audio":"/audio/120a4a40716cc36a6a5d.mp3"}]},{"text":"생산","meaning":"生产","explanation":"생산修饰방식。","readings":[{"term":"생산","audio":"/audio/b3df362a51cdd23e8944.mp3"},{"term":"방식","audio":"/audio/3f5e5497216f63d32822.mp3"}]},{"text":"방식도","meaning":"方式也","explanation":"방식（方式）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"방식","audio":"/audio/3f5e5497216f63d32822.mp3"}]},{"text":"달라져야","meaning":"需要改变","explanation":"달라지다（改变）+ -어야（必须）。","readings":[{"term":"달라져야","audio":"/audio/97dc82bfb2438c917fe6.mp3"}]},{"text":"하겠네요.","meaning":"看来应该","explanation":"하다 + -겠-（判断）+ -네요（新认识）；-아/어야 하다表示需要。","readings":[{"term":"하겠네요","audio":"/audio/9aaf3b38abb3239e1793.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c25-4","ko":"맞아요. 재사용이 쉬운 구조를 만들어야 해요.","zh":"是的，要建立便于重复使用的体系。","note":"쉬운 修饰结构；这里的 구조 指体系设计。","words":[{"term":"재사용","zh":"重复使用","id":"59f83bc301eb1d47","audio":"/audio/59f83bc301eb1d47afa2.mp3"},{"term":"구조","zh":"结构；体系","id":"74132db92c50ae3a","audio":"/audio/74132db92c50ae3a0a25.mp3"},{"term":"만들다","zh":"制造；建立","id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/e05a8139619e6652831e.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"是的","explanation":"맞다（正确）的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}]},{"text":"재사용이","meaning":"重复使用","explanation":"재사용（再次使用）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"재사용","audio":"/audio/59f83bc301eb1d47afa2.mp3"}]},{"text":"쉬운","meaning":"容易的","explanation":"쉽다（容易）→ 쉬운，ㅂ不规则的定语形。","readings":[{"term":"쉬운","audio":"/audio/315fb7ee8d1f47956146.mp3"}]},{"text":"구조를","meaning":"体系","explanation":"구조（结构、体系）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"구조","audio":"/audio/74132db92c50ae3a0a25.mp3"}]},{"text":"만들어야","meaning":"需要建立","explanation":"만들다（制造、建立）+ -어야（必须）。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"应该","explanation":"하다的礼貌形式，与前文构成必要性表达。","readings":[{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c25-5","ko":"소비자에게 비용이 전가될 우려는 없을까요?","zh":"会不会有成本转嫁给消费者的风险？","note":"우려 表示担忧。","words":[{"term":"소비자","zh":"消费者","id":"5eaa0c4876c201db","audio":"/audio/5eaa0c4876c201db316c.mp3"},{"term":"비용","zh":"费用；成本","id":"24423dd67b3a7826","audio":"/audio/24423dd67b3a782699d9.mp3"},{"term":"전가되다","zh":"被转嫁","id":"35fbba257fdda5ac","audio":"/audio/35fbba257fdda5ac8bdd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/749a1f04ce57bd4590b8.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"소비자에게","meaning":"向消费者","explanation":"소비자（消费者）+ 에게（动作的接受方）。","readings":[{"term":"소비자","audio":"/audio/5eaa0c4876c201db316c.mp3"}]},{"text":"비용이","meaning":"成本","explanation":"비용（成本、费用）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"비용","audio":"/audio/24423dd67b3a782699d9.mp3"}]},{"text":"전가될","meaning":"被转嫁的","explanation":"전가되다（被转嫁）+ -ㄹ（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"전가되다","audio":"/audio/35fbba257fdda5ac8bdd.mp3"}]},{"text":"우려는","meaning":"担忧／风险","explanation":"우려（担心不良情况发生）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"우려는","audio":"/audio/7d5b599512b72e75a5ea.mp3"}]},{"text":"없을까요?","meaning":"会不会有？","explanation":"없다（没有）+ -을까요（疑问）；以否定疑问委婉提出担忧。","readings":[{"term":"없을까요","audio":"/audio/5e0e0d34fc7020fd8e30.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c25-6","ko":"그 점까지 고려한 균형 잡힌 정책이 필요해요.","zh":"需要连这一点也考虑在内的均衡政策。","note":"균형 잡히다：保持平衡。","words":[{"term":"균형","zh":"平衡","id":"634269a095ddb1b1","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3"},{"term":"정책","zh":"政策","id":"ff41d4a47c5fd63e","audio":"/audio/ff41d4a47c5fd63e9a96.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/48d007f0eceef7a5c595.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그指上文成本转嫁的问题。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}]},{"text":"점까지","meaning":"连这一点也","explanation":"점（点、方面）+ 까지（连……也，范围追加）。","readings":[{"term":"점까지","audio":"/audio/f7f2a9ae06455d949b18.mp3"}]},{"text":"고려한","meaning":"考虑在内的","explanation":"고려하다（考虑）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"고려한","audio":"/audio/66808c6a890752c6ea08.mp3"}]},{"text":"균형","meaning":"平衡","explanation":"균형与잡히다构成“保持平衡”。","readings":[{"term":"균형","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3"}]},{"text":"잡힌","meaning":"得到平衡的","explanation":"잡히다 + -ㄴ（定语形）；균형 잡힌整体为“均衡的”。","readings":[{"term":"균형","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3"}]},{"text":"정책이","meaning":"政策","explanation":"정책（政策）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"정책","audio":"/audio/ff41d4a47c5fd63e9a96.mp3"}]},{"text":"필요해요.","meaning":"有必要","explanation":"필요하다的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"필요해요","audio":"/audio/67e74520ce9a35e80201.mp3"}]}]}],"day":121,"sequenceScore":2.16,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["消费者的购买方式也应该改变。","企业的生产方式没有必要改变。","企业的生产方式也应该改变。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["会不会有成本转嫁给消费者的风险？","会不会有消费者减少需求的风险？","会不会有成本全部由企业承担的可能？"],"answer":0}]}
